sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Пользователь
    participant Shop as Магазин
    participant Pay as Payment Service

    User->>Shop: оформить заказ
    activate Shop

    rect rgb(230, 230, 250)
        Note over Shop,Pay: ref: seq-payment-flow
        Shop->>Pay: процесс оплаты
        Pay-->>Shop: результат
    end

    Shop-->>User: заказ подтверждён
    deactivate Shop
